          "overview": "2009. Curitiba. University of Cinema. After the accidental death of Leandro, a student, inside the filming studio, Romero, the institution's janitor and Leandro's grandfather, after blaming the other 5 students for his grandson's death, kills, dismembers and buries the boys on the campus itself. This story becomes known nationwide as \"the boys in pieces\". 15 years later, another 6 students are producing a \"true crime\" documentary about this brutal crime and someone does not want this story to be told. New deaths begin to occur.",
